ard in 2003. ^ \"ACM Turing Award\" . 2003. published by the Association for Computing Machinery 2012 ^ Kay, Alan (1997). The Computer Revolution Hasn't Happened Yet (Speech). ^ \"Alan Kay | Biography, Inventions, & Facts | Britannica\" . www.britannica.com . Retrieved May 1, 2023 .",
